#53 100 MHz final: Vivado F0 timing check of the integrated branch before the CL build, 2026-10-24 UTC

Branch 53-100mhz-afi @ 759c066 (main 3b7ed1b with the #76/#77/#78 core fixes, the FPGA_TIMING PMP port
pmp_check_par with the #78 two-word rule, #53 4421934, the 100 MHz trial tooling, the relative-path host fix).
Tools: Vivado v2025.2 (64-bit) SW Build 6299465, F0 out-of-context flow fpga/f0/f0_ooc.tcl, xcvu47p-fsvh2892-2-e,
10 ns, F0_STRATEGY=iter (the #53 default), defines SYNTHESIS SIGIL_VRF_OREG SIGIL_FPGA_TIMING (the FPGA build's set),
8 threads, on sigil-fpga-build2 (r7iz.8xlarge, load ~33 from other jobs, so the wall time is longer than usual).
Remote worktree: sigil-fpga-build2:~/wt/100f-f0, run dir build/f0-100f-iter-10ns (checkpoints not committed).
