== Worst paths (impl_top_paths_first7.rpt)
+0.782  u_sha512 round_reg -> digest_out_reg / h_reg (crypto engine, 24 levels; was +1.250..+1.307 on 871b2dd,
        crypto RTL unchanged, placement)
+0.803  u_csr/pmpaddr_q -> data PMP (g_pmp_par hit4, the two-word rule) -> pmp_allow_data -> MEM exception ->
        trap commit -> CSR register CE (vsscratch, scause, mtinst, sscratch, ... 24 levels; worst family after SHA-512)
On 871b2dd the worst path was vls_started_q -> VLS address -> D-TLB -> u_mmu/g_dreg.mt_q[pa] at +0.690; on
759c066 that family starts at vl_q and is at +1.032 (family A of the #53 classifier).

